eft, both personal and institutional, as well as access to a wealth of assets and a comfortable degree of success in life, not an indication that the character is lying down on the job or not up to pulling his own weight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-17T09:08:40-07:00","id":1554422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Atticus Cleanclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1554321-is-augustus-giovanni-really-that-fat?p=1554412#post1554412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I believe the correct answer is \u2018Bull buffalo\u2019 or \u2018Kingpin\u2019 fat: it\u2019s a way to suggest real heft, both personal and institutional, as well as access to a wealth of assets and a comfortable degree of success in life, not an indication that the character is lying down on the job or not up to pulling his own weight.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, tbh I've always feltt that Augustus was somehow influenced by Kingpin lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_